  {
   "id": 33,
   "type": "MarkdownNote",
   "pos": [
    0,
    -640
   ],
   "size": [
    740,
    600
   ],
   "flags": {},
   "order": 8,
   "mode": 0,
   "inputs": [],
   "outputs": [],
   "properties": {},
   "widgets_values": [
    "## H3 LongTake: latent upscale of a finished project\n\nWorks on a project that is **already rendered** (folder `output/h3_longtake/<project>`): no clip is rendered again.\n\n1. **H3 LongTake Stitch**: type the project name in `project_name`. It stitches the base video and its new **latent** output gives the latent of the whole video (without the repeated context frames).\n2. **MiniMax H3 latent upscaler 3D** ([LBH-123-AI/Comfyui_Minimax_h3_latent_Upscaler](https://github.com/LBH-123-AI/Comfyui_Minimax_h3_latent_Upscaler), model `minimax_h3_latent_upscaler_3d_fp16` in `models/latent_upscale_models`): to `megapixels` (1.0 = about 832x1248). Video only: the audio goes around it.\n3. **MMH3 Split Upscale** (same pack): a light second pass in overlapping time chunks (73 frames, 22 overlap) with the model and LoRAs you rendered with, shift 12. Denoise 0.2 / 2 steps er_sde beta; for more detail 0.4 / 4 steps euler simple (slower).\n4. **VAE Decode (Tiled)** of the whole video in one go + audio -> mp4.\n\n**Decode only** (no upscale, to compare): connect the first `LTXVSeparateAVLatent` straight to VAE Decode (Tiled) and bypass the upscale nodes.\n\nMeasured on 10 s (480x704 -> 832x1248): 532 s on 16 GB. The joined latent is continuous when the project was rendered with `anchor_mode = inpaint` (default for Image to Video from 1.3.5)."
   ],
   "widgets_values_named": {
    "text": "## H3 LongTake: latent upscale of a finished project\n\nWorks on a project that is **already rendered** (folder `output/h3_longtake/<project>`): no clip is rendered again.\n\n1. **H3 LongTake Stitch**: type the project name in `project_name`. It stitches the base video and its new **latent** output gives the latent of the whole video (without the repeated context frames).\n2. **MiniMax H3 latent upscaler 3D** ([LBH-123-AI/Comfyui_Minimax_h3_latent_Upscaler](https://github.com/LBH-123-AI/Comfyui_Minimax_h3_latent_Upscaler), model `minimax_h3_latent_upscaler_3d_fp16` in `models/latent_upscale_models`): to `megapixels` (1.0 = about 832x1248). Video only: the audio goes around it.\n3. **MMH3 Split Upscale** (same pack): a light second pass in overlapping time chunks (73 frames, 22 overlap) with the model and LoRAs you rendered with, shift 12. Denoise 0.2 / 2 steps er_sde beta; for more detail 0.4 / 4 steps euler simple (slower).\n4. **VAE Decode (Tiled)** of the whole video in one go + audio -> mp4.\n\n**Decode only** (no upscale, to compare): connect the first `LTXVSeparateAVLatent` straight to VAE Decode (Tiled) and bypass the upscale nodes.\n\nMeasured on 10 s (480x704 -> 832x1248): 532 s on 16 GB. The joined latent is continuous when the project was rendered with `anchor_mode = inpaint` (default for Image to Video from 1.3.5)."
   },
   "color": "#432",
   "bgcolor": "#653"
  }
